// Floor and ceiling finishes, in building coordinates. Floors: 1/2 in engineered oak in the living,
// dining, hall and bedroom areas and 1/2 in porcelain tile (on a thin-set bed) in the kitchen,
// breakfast area, utility room and both baths, laid to the gypsum faces and partitions, around
// the post bases, and clear of the stair opening. Ceiling: the first-floor 1/2 in gypsum ceiling
// under the floor joists, open at the stair and around the posts. The second-floor ceiling is in
// envelope/roof.part, under the trusses.
part floor_finishes {
